# Check out text files with LF everywhere. Raw string literals in tests and SQL migrations embed line
# breaks verbatim, so a CRLF checkout on Windows changes what the code means, not just how it looks.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The source package (scripts/package-source.sh, git archive) carries the product: source, tests, build files and
# the documents a reader needs. Development process records and the owner's personal tooling stay out of it.
TRACK.md export-ignore
STATUS.md export-ignore
AGENTS.md export-ignore
CLAUDE.md export-ignore
.keep export-ignore
.github/ export-ignore
prototypes/ export-ignore
